jumo:ChangeSetProjection a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:comment "Observed record of the single atomic PR ForgeApplier opened for a ChangeSetProposal (multi-repository-change-set-saga AC2/AC5). Existence is idempotency evidence -- a second saga execution against the same changeSetProposalId returns this record instead of re-opening a PR." ;
