jumo:ChangeSetProposal a sh:NodeShape ;
    rdfs:comment "Ordered multi-file changeset proposed against one repository, the unit ForgeApplier opens as one repository PR within a multi-repository saga (multi-repository-change-set-saga AC1). Owner approval and phase progression are tracked separately, not on this shape." ;
